  "_notes": "DVWA's security level must be set to 'low' via DVWA Security for a meaningful first pass; raise it to measure detector behavior against mitigations. owned_markers values are placeholders -- fill in with real per-account strings you observe in a logged-in session before running the IDOR detector."
